  {q:"Why is reincarnation like gambling?", o:["You can win a better life","It is blind, with no control","It costs money"], a:1, w:"The positive side: like a nightmare, you can still wake up."},
  {q:"Can the mantra help you if you do not understand its meaning?", o:["No, never","Yes, if you say it sincerely, with respect and appreciation","Yes, but only in a temple"], a:1, w:"A sincere heart prepares the cause. With the meaning as well, it is a double force."},
  {q:"How does worry start?", o:["As pain and a fair warning that grows into fear","As a gift from birth","From too much joy"], a:0, w:"Being careful is not wrong if you stay calm. Worry becomes a blind habit when fear takes over."},
  {q:"What are the three parts of temporary releasing?", o:["Mind, psychology and body","Birth, aging and death","Argh, Oh and Mmm"], a:0, w:"Mind free from worry, psychology free from stress, and a powerful body. Then Mmm appears, and leads to Nirvana."}
